{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111916","id":2936993074,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6vDvUy","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111916","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111916.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111916.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111916","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111916/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111916/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111916/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7a12219bfcd1548364086e58ece9605b274f729d","number":111916,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add `zip_shortest` and `enumerate` iteration helpers.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Alternative to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111492\r\n\r\nAdds `zip_shortest` and `enumerate` iteration helpers.\r\nIf they're needed, I'll take this PR out of draft.\r\n\r\nNote that I'm not 100% sure we actually want this, due to its trade-offs.\r\n\r\n## How to use\r\n\r\n```c++\r\nconstexpr float a[5] = { 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 };\r\nconstexpr int b[5] = { 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 };\r\n\r\nfor (auto [ai, bi] : zip_shortest<float, int>(a, b)) {\r\n    print_line(\"a[i]: \", ai, \", b[i]: \", bi);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n```c++\r\nconstexpr float a[5] = { 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 };\r\n\r\nfor (auto [idx, ai] : enumerate<size_t, float>(a)) {\r\n    print_line(\"a[\", idx, \"]: \", ai);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Trade-off\r\n\r\nThere are some downsides to the implementation:\r\n- It's fairly complicated \"C++ magic\". This can be hard to understand and may impact compile time.\r\n- C++ [structured binding](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/structured_binding.html) does not support explicit types. It uses `auto`.\r\n\r\nThat being said, there are upsides:\r\n- Both `enumerate` and `zip` work very similarly as in other languages (e.g. python, Rust), and should be instantly familiar.\r\n- Use of these helpers encourages using iterators, which is often more efficient than index based iteration.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\nPart of the implementation adds `std::get` support to our `Tuple`. This would also allow code like this:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\nTuple<int, bool, float> tuple;\r\n\r\n// Direct access\r\nint a = tuple.get<0>();\r\nint b = tuple.get<1>();\r\nfloat b = tuple.get<2>();\r\n\r\n// std-like access\r\nint a = std::get<0>(tuple);\r\nint b = std::get<1>(tuple);\r\nfloat b = std::get<2>(tuple);\r\n\r\n// Destructure\r\nauto [a, b, c] = tuple;\r\n```\r\n\r\nWe may wish to merge this separately, although there is no explicit reason to do it (and destructuring uses `auto` anyway).\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5796,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:35:07Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-10-22T12:31:34Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T20:57:48Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[]